# Boutique Style

**Website URL:** [https://valealonso-star.github.io/practica1-bd/](https://valealonso-star.github.io/practica1-bd/)

Boutique Style is a web application designed to manage and track boutique inventory, including product availability, colors, sizes, quantities, purchases, stock levels, and supplier information.

---

## Team Members and Contributions

- **Alonso Peña Valeria** – Contributed the original idea and defined the project's main focus and objectives.
- **Martinez Gonzalez Irvin** – Contributed to the design of the application and its user interface.
- **Perez Mateos Evelyn Yamilet** – Researched how to develop and implement the project and contributed to the design.

---

## How to Run the Project

### View the Website
To view the live static website, open the following URL in your web browser:
`https://valealonso-star.github.io/practica1-bd/`

### Run the Project Locally
If you want to view or test the static files locally on your machine, clone the repository and open the entry file:

```bash
git clone [https://github.com/ValeAlonso-star/practica1-bd.git](https://github.com/ValeAlonso-star/practica1-bd.git)
cd practica1-bd
# Open docs/index.html in your preferred web browser
